  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The total number of acidic oxides from the following list is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>CO</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math></p>"
